      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## NTN Roaming Lab \u2014 monitoring overview\n\n**Domain colors:** HOME `#2E7D32` \u00b7 VISITED `#1565C0` \u00b7 IPX `#EF6C00` \u00b7 RAN `#6A1B9A`\n\n**Catalog:** 28 steps (auth=9, reg=7, pdu=12). **Active capture (from exporter tc_id):** expected denominator via `roaming_flow_expected_steps_total{phase=\"all\"}` (TC-05 reference = 23, excludes N/A HR-only pdu steps).\n\n**B1 same-PLMN camp (001/01)** \u2014 not production VPLMN 999/70. **SEPP/N32 absent.** Open **[02 \u2014 5G Roaming Flow](/d/ntn-5g-roaming-flow)** for post-capture ladder.\n\nThresholds: green=observed \u00b7 yellow=partial_expected \u00b7 red=missing"
      }
    },
